WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:27.232
Cat raced back to the Throne Room.

2
00:00:27.233 --> 00:00:32.362
"Tom!" she cried.

3
00:00:32.363 --> 00:00:35.720
"Daimon locked the king in the Grim Dungeon.

4
00:00:35.721 --> 00:00:38.540
He wants to take over the castle!"

5
00:00:38.541 --> 00:00:41.832
Tom gasped.

6
00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:44.478
"We must save the king!"

7
00:00:44.479 --> 00:00:47.271
Dirk could not hear Cat.

8
00:00:47.272 --> 00:00:49.815
He scowled at Tom.

9
00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:55.677
"What are you talking about?"

10
00:00:55.678 --> 00:00:59.525
Tom told Dirk about Daimon.

11
00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:03.211
"Don't make up stories!" Dirk snapped.

12
00:01:03.212 --> 00:01:05.601
He waved an arm at the tub.

13
00:01:05.602 --> 00:01:13.457
"Daimon is a good wizard—unlike you!"

14
00:01:13.458 --> 00:01:17.346
Cat growled softly.

15
00:01:17.347 --> 00:01:21.070
"Tom has a good heart," she hissed.

16
00:01:21.071 --> 00:01:24.025
But only Tom could hear her.

17
00:01:24.026 --> 00:01:28.463
Ann hurried in.

18
00:01:28.464 --> 00:01:31.832
"What's going on, Father?" she asked.

19
00:01:31.833 --> 00:01:35.648
"Tom is making up stories," Dirk said.

20
00:01:35.649 --> 00:01:39.270
"He says Daimon is taking over the castle."

21
00:01:39.271 --> 00:01:43.406
Ann gasped. "Oh no!"

22
00:01:43.407 --> 00:01:46.288
Dirk shook his head.

23
00:01:46.289 --> 00:01:48.077
"It's a lie.

24
00:01:48.078 --> 00:01:50.966
I'm going to the dungeon to see for myself."

25
00:01:50.967 --> 00:01:55.560
Dirk stomped off.

26
00:01:55.561 --> 00:01:58.840
Cat ran after him.

27
00:01:58.841 --> 00:02:02.126
Ann looked at Tom.

28
00:02:02.127 --> 00:02:04.145
Tom crossed his heart.

29
00:02:04.146 --> 00:02:06.704
"It's true, Ann."

30
00:02:06.705 --> 00:02:09.760
"I believe you, Tom," Ann said.

31
00:02:09.761 --> 00:02:14.600
"We can fight Daimon!"

32
00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:17.048
Ann explained her plan.

33
00:02:17.049 --> 00:02:18.813
"I will get the servants.

34
00:02:18.814 --> 00:02:21.088
You go get the guards.

35
00:02:21.089 --> 00:02:23.767
We can all stop that wizard!"

36
00:02:23.768 --> 00:02:27.075
"That's a good plan," Tom said.

37
00:02:27.076 --> 00:02:38.521
"We'll all gather here in a few minutes!"
